          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 11 2025 21:09:16 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Milled device</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Distraction body is a single unit milled from one solid block of titanium&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Footplates are not welded onto the distractor body, diminishing weak-points between the body and footplate connection<sup>1</sup></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri May 30 2025 16:23:17 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
