          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 11 2025 21:09:16 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Anti-reverse mechanism</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mechanism is located discreetly within the distractor body</li>\n<li>Once activated it prevents the device from distracting in the reverse direction</li>\n</ul>\n",
