          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 11 2025 21:09:16 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Type II anodization</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Body and footplates undergo Type II anodization, improving the surface finish<sup>2</sup></li>\n<li>Finish may reduce the risk for tissue and bone adhesion, which can simplify the device removal<sup>3</sup></li>\n</ul>\n",
