          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Concealed distraction mechanism</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Slot location potentially reduces&nbsp;exposure to osteotomy site</li>\n<li>With less exposure to the osteotomy&nbsp;site, risk for tissue interference may be reduced<sup>4</sup></li>\n</ul>\n",
